# ShadowSync

ShadowSync is a lightweight and intelligent file synchronization tool built with Python. It continuously monitors selected folders, detects file changes in real time, and automatically synchronizes them with backup locations or remote directories.

## Features

* Real-time file monitoring
* Automatic backup creation
* Incremental synchronization
* Change history logging
* Cross-platform support (Windows, Linux, macOS)
* Configurable synchronization rules
* Command-line interface

## Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/shadowsync.git
cd shadowsync
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Usage

```bash
python shadowsync.py --source ./Documents --target ./Backup
```

## Example

```python
from shadowsync import SyncManager

sync = SyncManager(
    source="Documents",
    target="Backup"
)

sync.start()
```

